    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19560" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰσί̆λ-ισσα</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
